#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid "An autosaved SCURK project is available."
msgstr "Ein automatisch gespeichertes SCURK-Projekt ist verfügbar."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid "Pond, Lake, or River"
