#. source.
msgid ""
"You are visiting another city. Only your emergency services may assist here."
msgstr ""
"Du besuchst eine andere Stadt. Hier dürfen nur deine Einsatzkräfte helfen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Region cities own their entire map. Land trading is available in Shared "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Regionsstädte besitzen ihre gesamte Karte. Landhandel gibt es im Shared-"
"Modus."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Neighbouring cities"
msgstr "Nachbarstädte"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Victory"
msgstr "Sieg"

