#. source.
msgid "Continue without scoring (endless)"
msgstr "Ohne Wertung weiterspielen (Endlos)"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Neighbouring cities are available in Region mode."
msgstr "Nachbarstädte sind im Region-Modus verfügbar."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Visit any city to watch. During disasters you may deploy your own emergency "
"services; other changes remain with its owner."
msgstr ""
"Besuche jede Stadt zum Zuschauen. Bei Katastrophen kannst du eigene "
"Einsatzkräfte entsenden; andere Änderungen bleiben dem Besitzer vorbehalten."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Return to your city"
msgstr "Zur eigenen Stadt"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Visit city"
msgstr "Stadt besuchen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Victory: %s. The game is paused. Leave or let the host continue without "
"scoring."
msgstr ""
"Sieg: %s. Die Partie ist pausiert. Verlasse sie oder lass den Host ohne "
"Wertung fortsetzen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Visiting another city: watch or deploy your own emergency services."
msgstr ""
"Zu Besuch in einer anderen Stadt: Zuschauen oder eigene Einsatzkräfte "
"entsenden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Readiness can only be changed in the lobby."
msgstr "Die Bereitschaft kann nur in der aktuellen Lobby geändert werden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Readiness updated."
msgstr "Bereitschaft aktualisiert."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can start when all connected players are ready."
msgstr "Nur der Host kann starten, wenn alle verbundenen Spieler bereit sind."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The game has started."
msgstr "Das Spiel wurde gestartet."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Wait until the host starts the game."
msgstr "Warte, bis der Host das Spiel startet."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Game lobby"
msgstr "Spiellobby"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "Bereit"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Not ready"
msgstr "Nicht bereit"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Offline"
msgstr "Offline"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Start game"
msgstr "Spiel starten"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"At least two players must join. Everyone confirms Ready; the host then "
"starts the game. Changes to the player list reset readiness."
msgstr ""
"Mindestens zwei Spieler müssen beitreten. Alle bestätigen „Bereit“, danach "
"startet der Host. Bei Änderungen an der Spielerliste wird die Bereitschaft "
"zurückgesetzt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Simulation and construction begin together after the host starts."
msgstr "Simulation und Bauen beginnen gemeinsam, sobald der Host startet."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Net wealth"
msgstr "Nettovermögen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Open scoreboard"
msgstr "Statistikübersicht öffnen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Endless game · no scoring"
msgstr "Endlosspiel · ohne Wertung"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Victory target: %s"
msgstr "Siegziel: %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "You: %s / %s"
msgstr "Du: %s / %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Leading: %s · %s"
msgstr "Führend: %s · %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Net wealth = city funds minus outstanding debt."
msgstr "Nettovermögen = Stadtkasse abzüglich ausstehender Schulden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Population of your own city."
msgstr "Einwohnerzahl deiner eigenen Stadt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "History"
msgstr "Verlauf"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Unranked"
msgstr "Außer Wertung"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"History begins when the game starts; a new sample is recorded each month."
msgstr ""
"Der Verlauf beginnt beim Spielstart; jeden Monat wird ein neuer Wert "
"erfasst."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Month %d"
msgstr "Monat %d"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Player colours · hover over a line for exact values"
msgstr "Spielerfarben · Für genaue Werte auf eine Linie zeigen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Rematch · rotate starts"
msgstr "Revanche · Startplätze wechseln"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"No unused fair starting positions remain. Create a new game with new "
"terrain."
msgstr ""
"Es gibt keine unbenutzten geeigneten Startplätze mehr. Erstelle eine neue "
"Partie mit neuem Terrain."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can propose a rematch after the result."
msgstr "Nur der Host kann nach dem Ergebnis eine Revanche vorschlagen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Rematch prepared with new starting positions. Everyone must confirm Ready "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Revanche mit neuen Startplätzen vorbereitet. Alle müssen erneut ihre "
"Bereitschaft bestätigen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Target held: %d / %d game days"
msgstr "Ziel gehalten: %d / %d Spieltage"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Unranked · city founded after the start"
msgstr "Außer Wertung · Stadt nach Spielstart gegründet"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Stay at or above the target for one full game year. Dropping below resets "
"the timer."
msgstr ""
"Halte das Ziel ein volles Spieljahr lang. Beim Unterschreiten beginnt die "
"Frist erneut."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Rules are fixed at start: hold the target for one game year; late-founded "
"cities are unranked. Shared starts receive equal land grants."
msgstr ""
"Regeln ab Spielstart: Ziel ein Spieljahr halten; später gegründete Städte "
"bleiben außer Wertung. Shared-Städte erhalten gleich große Startflächen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Player loans"
msgstr "Spielerkredite"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Both players confirm the terms. Interest is paid each year; principal is due"
" at maturity. Unpaid amounts remain debt; interest does not compound."
msgstr ""
"Beide Spieler bestätigen die Konditionen. Zinsen werden jährlich gezahlt, "
"der Kredit am Laufzeitende getilgt. Unbezahlte Beträge bleiben Schulden; es "
"gibt keinen Zinseszins."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Proposal"
msgstr "Vorschlag"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Request a loan"
msgstr "Kredit anfragen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Offer a loan"
msgstr "Kredit anbieten"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Fixed annual interest (%)"
msgstr "Fester Jahreszins (%)"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Term (game years)"
msgstr "Laufzeit (Spieljahre)"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Confirm and send proposal"
msgstr "Bestätigen und Vorschlag senden"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "%s → %s · %s · %d%% annually · %d years"
msgstr "%s → %s · %s · %d%% jährlich · %d Jahre"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Accept fixed terms"
msgstr "Feste Konditionen annehmen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Outstanding: %s · Unpaid interest: %s · Maturity: game day %d"
msgstr "Restschuld: %s · Offene Zinsen: %s · Fällig am Spieltag %d"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid loan terms or contract limit reached."
msgstr "Ungültige Kreditkonditionen oder Vertragslimit erreicht."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan proposal sent. The other player must confirm the fixed terms."
msgstr ""
"Kreditvorschlag gesendet. Der andere Spieler muss die festen Konditionen "
"bestätigen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan proposal withdrawn or declined."
msgstr "Kreditvorschlag zurückgezogen oder abgelehnt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The lender cannot fund this loan or the receiving treasury is full."
msgstr ""
"Der Kreditgeber kann den Betrag nicht aufbringen oder die empfangende "
"Stadtkasse ist voll."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan accepted. Annual interest and the maturity date are fixed."
msgstr "Kredit angenommen. Jahreszins und Fälligkeitsdatum sind festgelegt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "This loan action is no longer available."
msgstr "Diese Kreditaktion ist nicht mehr verfügbar."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Player loans require separate city finances."
msgstr "Spielerkredite erfordern getrennte Stadtfinanzen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid saved competition data."
msgstr "Ungültige gespeicherte Wettbewerbsdaten."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Awaiting host confirmation…"
msgstr "Warte auf Bestätigung des Hosts…"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Region %d"
msgstr "Region %d"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Scored competitions require undeveloped starting terrain. Create a new city."
msgstr ""
"Gewertete Wettbewerbe erfordern unbebautes Startgelände. Erstelle eine neue "
"Stadt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Withdraw"
msgstr "Zurückziehen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Quit multiplayer"
msgstr "Multiplayer beenden"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Save the multiplayer game before quitting? All connected players will be "
"disconnected."
msgstr ""
"Multiplayer-Spielstand vor dem Beenden speichern? Die Verbindung aller "
"Mitspieler wird getrennt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Save and quit"
msgstr "Speichern und beenden"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Quit without saving"
msgstr "Ohne Speichern beenden"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can change the game speed."
msgstr "Nur der Host kann die Spielgeschwindigkeit ändern."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Select a city to visit. You can watch every city and send emergency "
"assistance during disasters."
msgstr ""
"Wähle eine Stadt zum Besuchen. Du kannst jede Stadt beobachten und bei "
"Katastrophen Einsatzkräfte zur Unterstützung schicken."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Apply colour"
msgstr "Farbe übernehmen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Price for additional neutral land. At the shared start, every city receives "
"an equal free starting area; its treasury stays intact. Saved games retain "
"their rules."
msgstr ""
"Preis für zusätzliches neutrales Land. Beim gemeinsamen Start erhält jede "
"Stadt ein gleich großes kostenloses Startgebiet; die Stadtkasse bleibt "
"erhalten. Gespeicherte Partien behalten ihre Regeln."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Host a game on this computer, or connect to an existing host."
msgstr ""
"Erstelle ein Spiel auf diesem Computer oder verbinde dich mit einem "
"bestehenden Host."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Your name in the lobby, chat and scoreboard."
msgstr "Dein Name in der Lobby, im Chat und in der Statistikübersicht."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Choose a custom colour for your cursor, territory and statistics, then Apply"
" colour."
msgstr ""
"Wähle eine eigene Farbe für Mauszeiger, Gebiet und Statistiken und bestätige"
" mit „Farbe übernehmen“."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Enter the host computer's LAN address or reachable IP address."
msgstr ""
"Gib die LAN-Adresse oder erreichbare IP-Adresse des Host-Computers ein."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The host and joining players must use the same TCP port."
msgstr "Host und beitretende Spieler müssen denselben TCP-Port verwenden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Co-op: one shared city. Shared: separate cities on one map. Region: "
"independent neighbouring city maps."
msgstr ""
"Koop: eine gemeinsame Stadt. Shared: getrennte Städte auf einer Karte. "
"Region: unabhängige benachbarte Stadtkarten."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Generate new terrain, or continue a saved multiplayer game. Saved games keep"
" their rules and player seats."
msgstr ""
"Erzeuge neues Gelände oder setze eine gespeicherte Multiplayer-Partie fort. "
"Gespeicherte Partien behalten Regeln und Spielerplätze."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Leave empty to allow joining without a password."
msgstr "Leer lassen, um einen Beitritt ohne Passwort zu erlauben."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Enter the game's password if the host set one; otherwise leave empty."
msgstr ""
"Gib das Spielpasswort ein, falls eines vergeben wurde. Andernfalls leer "
"lassen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Configure the city, then wait in the lobby until everyone is ready."
msgstr "Richte die Stadt ein und warte in der Lobby, bis alle bereit sind."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Connect and select a new or reserved player seat. The host controls the game"
" rules."
msgstr ""
"Verbinde dich und wähle einen neuen oder reservierten Spielerplatz. Der Host"
" legt die Spielregeln fest."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Population: residents of your own city. Suggested targets: 2,000 for a short"
" development goal, 10,000 for a medium goal, 50,000 for a long goal."
msgstr ""
"Bevölkerung: Einwohner deiner eigenen Stadt. Zielvorschläge: 2.000 für ein "
"kurzes, 10.000 für ein mittleres und 50.000 für ein langes Aufbauziel."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Net wealth: treasury minus bank bonds and outstanding player debt. Suggested"
" targets: $50,000, $100,000 or $500,000 for increasingly long economic "
"goals."
msgstr ""
"Vermögen: Stadtkasse abzüglich Bankanleihen und offener Spielerschulden. "
"Zielvorschläge: $50.000, $100.000 oder $500.000 für zunehmend längere "
"Wirtschaftsziele."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Build without a victory target or time limit."
msgstr "Baue ohne Siegziel oder Zeitlimit."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"The target must then be held for one full game year (300 game days). At "
"uninterrupted simulation speed, that year takes about 4 minutes at Turtle, 2"
" at Llama or 1 at Cheetah. Swallow advances one day per processed frame "
"(about 5 seconds per year at 60 simulation frames/s). Development time is "
"additional and depends on difficulty, terrain, experience, pauses and "
"computer performance; these are not match-duration guarantees."
msgstr ""
"Das Ziel muss anschließend ein volles Spieljahr (300 Spieltage) gehalten "
"werden. Ohne Unterbrechungen dauert dieses Jahr etwa 4 Minuten bei "
"Schildkröte, 2 bei Lama oder 1 bei Gepard. Schwalbe berechnet einen Tag pro "
"Simulationsbild (etwa 5 Sekunden pro Jahr bei 60 Simulationsbildern/s). Die "
"Aufbauzeit kommt hinzu und hängt von Schwierigkeit, Gelände, Erfahrung, "
"Pausen und Rechnerleistung ab; dies sind keine garantierten Partiedauern."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Choose the lender and principal. The game sets the bond rate. Interest "
"settles with the annual budget; there is no maturity date. Repay when funds "
"permit."
msgstr ""
"Wähle Kreditgeber und Nennbetrag. Das Spiel legt den Anleihezins fest. "
"Zinsen werden mit dem Jahresbudget abgerechnet; es gibt keine feste "
"Laufzeit. Zahle zurück, sobald deine Mittel es erlauben."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Lender"
msgstr "Kreditgeber"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "%s → %s · %s · %d%% annually"
msgstr "%s → %s · %s · %d%% jährlich"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Approve loan"
msgstr "Kredit genehmigen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Outstanding: %s · Unpaid interest: %s"
msgstr "Restschuld: %s · Offene Zinsen: %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Repay principal"
msgstr "Nennbetrag zurückzahlen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Choose a lender and a principal in $10,000 bond units."
msgstr ""
"Wähle einen Kreditgeber und einen Nennbetrag in Anleihen zu je $10.000."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The normal bond credit limit does not permit this loan."
msgstr "Die normale Anleihe-Kreditgrenze erlaubt diesen Kredit nicht."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan requested. The lender must approve the game's bond rate."
msgstr ""
"Kredit angefragt. Der Kreditgeber muss den vom Spiel festgelegten "
"Anleihezins bestätigen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The bond rate or credit limit changed. Send a new request."
msgstr ""
"Anleihezins oder Kreditgrenze haben sich geändert. Stelle eine neue Anfrage."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Loan accepted. Interest follows the bond budget; repay the principal when "
"funds permit."
msgstr ""
"Kredit angenommen. Zinsen werden mit dem Anleihebudget abgerechnet; zahle "
"den Nennbetrag zurück, sobald deine Mittel es erlauben."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Insufficient funds to repay this loan."
msgstr "Nicht genügend Mittel zur Rückzahlung dieses Kredits."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan principal repaid."
msgstr "Kreditnennbetrag zurückgezahlt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "City names can only be changed in the lobby."
msgstr "Stadtnamen können nur in der Spiellobby geändert werden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "City name updated."
msgstr "Stadtname aktualisiert."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Click your city name to rename it before the game starts."
msgstr "Klicke auf deinen Stadtnamen, um ihn vor Spielstart zu ändern."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can control disasters."
msgstr "Nur der Host kann Katastrophen steuern."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can control disasters and simulation time."
msgstr "Nur der Host kann Katastrophen und die Simulationszeit steuern."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "No purchasable tiles selected. Nothing was charged."
msgstr "Keine kaufbaren Felder ausgewählt. Es wurde nichts berechnet."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Select land belonging to another player to send a purchase request."
msgstr "Wähle Land eines anderen Spielers aus, um eine Kaufanfrage zu senden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Request land"
msgstr "Land anfragen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Select neutral tiles to buy at the displayed price. Owned tiles are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Wähle neutrale Felder zum angezeigten Preis aus. Bereits belegte Felder "
"werden übersprungen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Set a price, then select your land to offer."
msgstr "Lege einen Preis fest und wähle dann dein Land für das Angebot aus."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Land: %d tiles · Total %s · Allowance %s · City funds %s"
msgstr "Land: %d Felder · Gesamt %s · Landbudget %s · Stadtkasse %s"

