#. source.
msgid "Counteroffer sent. The other player must confirm the new price."
msgstr ""
"Gegenangebot gesendet. Der andere Spieler muss den neuen Preis bestätigen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Game goal"
msgstr "Spielziel"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid administration history."
msgstr "Ungültiges Administrationsprotokoll."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid land protection map."
msgstr "Ungültige Karte der geschützten Flächen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
