msgstr "Ungültiges Starthandicap."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Land trade"
msgstr "Landhandel"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Inbox"
msgstr "Eingang"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Outbox"
msgstr "Ausgang"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Not enough connected land for these starts and reserved expansion areas. "
"Adjust handicaps or generate new terrain."
msgstr ""
"Nicht genug zusammenhängendes Land für diese Start- und Erweiterungsflächen."
" Passe die Handicaps an oder erzeuge neues Gelände."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Offer price updated. Previous confirmations are no longer valid."
msgstr "Angebotspreis aktualisiert. Frühere Bestätigungen gelten nicht mehr."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can assign handicaps before a new game starts."
msgstr ""
"Nur der Host kann vor dem Start einer neuen Partie Handicaps vergeben."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can use debug actions."
msgstr "Nur der Host kann Debugaktionen verwenden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Publish offer"
msgstr "Angebot veröffentlichen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Reserved land and public corridors cannot be traded."
msgstr ""
"Reservierte Flächen und öffentliche Korridore können nicht gehandelt werden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "This parcel does not connect to the buyer's city."
msgstr "Dieses Grundstück schließt nicht an die Stadt des Käufers an."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "This sale would split the seller's remaining land."
msgstr ""
"Dieser Verkauf würde das verbleibende Gebiet des Verkäufers aufteilen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Review"
msgstr "Prüfen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Review land trade"
msgstr "Landhandel prüfen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Rules are fixed at start: hold the target for one game year; late-founded "
"cities are unranked. Starting handicaps are visible in the lobby."
msgstr ""
"Regeln ab Spielstart: Ziel ein Spieljahr halten; später gegründete Städte "
"bleiben außer Wertung. Starthandicaps sind in der Lobby sichtbar."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Select a city to visit. Other cities are read-only; their dialogs remain "
"private."
msgstr ""
"Wähle eine Stadt zum Besichtigen. Andere Städte sind schreibgeschützt; ihre "
"Dialoge bleiben privat."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Select a parcel to review its owner, price and available trade action."
msgstr ""
"Wähle eine Fläche aus, um Besitzer, Preis und mögliche Handelsaktion zu "
"prüfen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Send counteroffer"
msgstr "Gegenangebot senden"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Solid: owned land. Hatched: reserved expansion. Grey: public road and power "
"corridors."
msgstr ""
"Flächig: Landbesitz. Schraffiert: reservierte Erweiterung. Grau: öffentliche"
" Straßen- und Stromkorridore."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Starting funds"
msgstr "Startvermögen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Starting handicap"
msgstr "Starthandicap"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
