msgstr "Es steht keine Entscheidung aus."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "This city view is read-only. Return to your own city to make changes."
msgstr ""
"Diese Stadtansicht ist schreibgeschützt. Kehre für Änderungen zu deiner "
"eigenen Stadt zurück."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Total price"
msgstr "Gesamtpreis"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
