#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"This selection contains several owners. Choose one parcel to negotiate."
msgstr ""
"Diese Auswahl enthält mehrere Besitzer. Wähle ein Grundstück für die "
"Verhandlung."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Funds: $%d · Start tiles: %d (0 = automatic)"
msgstr "Kasse: $%d · Startfelder: %d (0 = automatisch)"

