msgstr "%d Land · %d Wasser · %d Felder reserviert"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Accumulate %d years as sole leader. Earned time is kept. Late cities are "
"unranked."
msgstr ""
"Sammle %d Jahre alleinige Führung. Gesammelte Zeit bleibt erhalten. Späte "
"Städte sind ungewertet."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"All cities merge: shared terrain once, combined funds and bank bonds, "
"internal player loans cancel. Host tax and funding settings apply. More than"
" 50 bank bonds are repaid from combined funds."
msgstr ""
"Alle Städte werden zusammengeführt: gemeinsame Karte, addierte Kassen und "
"Bankanleihen. Interne Spielerkredite entfallen. Steuern und Budget des Hosts"
" gelten. Bankanleihen über dem Limit von 50 werden aus der gemeinsamen Kasse"
" getilgt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Below target"
msgstr "Ziel unterschritten"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Choose a new filename; existing cities are kept."
msgstr "Neuen Dateinamen wählen; bestehende Städte bleiben erhalten."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
