#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "New land trade · response requested"
msgstr "Neuer Landhandel · Antwort erbeten"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Land trade: %d tiles · %s"
msgstr "Landhandel: %d Felder · %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "No confirmed copy of your city is available."
msgstr "Keine bestätigte Kopie deiner Stadt verfügbar."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Only the sole leader at or above the target earns time. Earned time is kept;"
" ties pause all clocks."
msgstr ""
"Nur wer das Ziel erreicht und allein führt, sammelt Zeit. Gesammelte Zeit "
"bleibt erhalten; bei Gleichstand pausieren alle Zähler."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Open a single-player copy or continue multiplayer."
msgstr "Einzelspielerkopie öffnen oder Multiplayer fortsetzen."

