#. source.
msgid "Single-player copy opened. Save it as a new city."
msgstr "Einzelspielerkopie geöffnet. Speichere sie als neue Stadt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Points after game time"
msgstr "Punkte nach Spielzeit"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Points"
msgstr "Punkte"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"1 point per 100 residents + 1 point per $1,000 net wealth (funds minus "
"debt). Highest score at the deadline wins; ties share victory. Late cities "
"are unranked."
msgstr ""
"1 Punkt je 100 Einwohner + 1 Punkt je $1.000 Nettovermögen (Kasse minus "
"Schulden). Am Ende gewinnt die höchste Punktzahl; Gleichstände teilen den "
"Sieg. Späte Städte bleiben ungewertet."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Duration in game years"
msgstr "Dauer in Spieljahren"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Starts when the host starts the game. The lobby shows the end year. Paused "
"game time does not count."
msgstr ""
"Beginnt mit dem Spielstart durch den Host. Die Lobby zeigt das Endjahr. "
"Pausierte Spielzeit zählt nicht."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "%d game years · End year %d"
msgstr "%d Spieljahre · Endjahr %d"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "End year %d · %d years, %d days remaining"
msgstr "Endjahr %d · Noch %d Jahre, %d Tage"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "%s points"
msgstr "%s Punkte"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Bar relative to the leading positive score."
msgstr "Balken relativ zur höchsten positiven Punktzahl."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Another player's reservation and public corridors cannot be traded."
msgstr "Fremde Reservierungen und öffentliche Korridore sind nicht handelbar."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Reserved land has a fixed field price payable to the game."
msgstr "Reserviertes Land hat einen festen Feldpreis, zahlbar an das Spiel."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid land reservation request."
msgstr "Ungültige Freigabeanfrage."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Select another player's reserved land."
msgstr "Wähle reserviertes Land eines anderen Spielers."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The reservation changed; nothing was charged."
msgstr "Die Reservierung hat sich geändert. Keine Zahlung erfolgt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Reservation release requested. The buyer pays the game only after approval."
msgstr ""
"Freigabe angefragt. Der Käufer zahlt erst nach Zustimmung an das Spiel."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The field price changed; send a new request."
msgstr "Der Feldpreis hat sich geändert. Stelle eine neue Anfrage."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Reservation released and land purchased. Payment went to the game."
msgstr "Reservierung freigegeben, Land gekauft. Zahlung an das Spiel erfolgt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Release reserved land"
msgstr "Reserviertes Land freigeben"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Payment to game"
msgstr "Zahlung an das Spiel"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Release only this parcel. The buyer pays the game; you receive no money."
msgstr ""
"Nur diese Fläche freigeben. Der Käufer zahlt an das Spiel; du erhältst kein "
"Geld."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Approve release"
msgstr "Freigabe bestätigen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Reserved"
msgstr "Reserviert"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"The reserving player must approve. Payment goes to the game after approval."
msgstr ""
"Der reservierende Spieler muss zustimmen. Erst danach erfolgt die Zahlung an"
" das Spiel."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Fields with a pencil can be edited."
msgstr "Felder mit Stift sind bearbeitbar."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Change starting funds"
msgstr "Startvermögen ändern"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Change starting territory"
msgstr "Startfläche ändern"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Cities"
msgstr "Städte"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Shared sign"
msgstr "Gemeinsames Schild"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Leave the session? Unsaved changes on the host will be lost.\n"
"As host, you will disconnect all other players."
msgstr ""
"Sitzung verlassen? Nicht gespeicherte Änderungen gehen beim Host verloren.\n"
"Als Host trennst du dabei alle Mitspieler."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Game running on port %d. Choose a game speed."
msgstr "Partie läuft auf Port %d. Wähle eine Spielgeschwindigkeit."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Connecting to the host…"
msgstr "Verbinde mit dem Host …"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid city state from the host. Leave the session and reconnect."
msgstr "Ungültiger Stadtzustand vom Host. Sitzung beenden und neu verbinden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Multiplayer connected"
msgstr "Multiplayer verbunden"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The host saves the shared game."
msgstr "Der Host speichert die gemeinsame Partie."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Multiplayer game saved: %s"
msgstr "Multiplayer-Spielstand gespeichert: %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Left multiplayer"
msgstr "Multiplayer verlassen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Finish creating the terrain with Start City first."
msgstr "Beende zuerst die Landschaftserstellung mit Stadt starten."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Use a player name of 1–32 characters and an optional password of at most 64 "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"Verwende einen Spielernamen mit 1–32 Zeichen und ein optionales Passwort mit"
" höchstens 64 Zeichen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Cannot listen on TCP port %d: %s"
msgstr "TCP-Port %d kann nicht geöffnet werden: %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Leave the hosted session first."
msgstr "Verlasse zuerst die gehostete Sitzung."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Cannot connect: %s"
msgstr "Verbindung nicht möglich: %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "This is a different session. Leave before joining it."
msgstr ""
"Dies ist eine andere Sitzung. Verlasse die aktuelle, bevor du beitrittst."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid command identifier."
msgstr "Ungültige Befehlskennung."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "This command was already handled; it was not applied again."
msgstr "Dieser Befehl wurde bereits verarbeitet und nicht erneut angewendet."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Command order changed. Reconnect to synchronize."
msgstr "Befehlsreihenfolge geändert. Zum Synchronisieren neu verbinden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid speed."
msgstr "Ungültige Geschwindigkeit."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Your requested speed was updated."
msgstr "Deine gewünschte Geschwindigkeit wurde aktualisiert."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Disconnected. Reconnect before making changes."
msgstr "Verbindung getrennt. Vor Änderungen neu verbinden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Cannot synchronize the city."
msgstr "Stadt kann nicht synchronisiert werden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Connection lost or refused. Check host, port and password, then reconnect. "
"The view is frozen."
msgstr ""
"Verbindung verloren oder abgelehnt. Host, Port und Passwort prüfen und neu "
"verbinden. Die Ansicht ist eingefroren."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host saves the shared session."
msgstr "Nur der Host speichert die gemeinsame Sitzung."

