#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host saves the game."
msgstr "Nur der Host speichert die Partie."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Cannot write the city."
msgstr "Stadt kann nicht geschrieben werden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Cannot verify the saved city."
msgstr "Die gespeicherte Stadt kann nicht geprüft werden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Cannot replace the previous backup."
msgstr "Die vorherige Sicherung kann nicht ersetzt werden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Cannot back up the previous city."
