msgstr "Dieses Gebiet wurde geändert. Prüfe es und versuche es erneut."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "A sign can contain at most 120 characters."
msgstr "Ein Schild darf höchstens 120 Zeichen enthalten."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid construction choice."
msgstr "Ungültige Bauauswahl."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid tool."
