msgstr "Verbinden und Gesamtkosten prüfen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Build without connection"
msgstr "Ohne Verbindung bauen"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Build this tunnel?"
msgstr "Diesen Tunnel bauen?"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Build — $%d"
msgstr "Bauen — $%d"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
