msgstr ""
"Ein anderer Spieler hat einen Teil dieses Gebäudes oder Geländes geändert. "
"Versuche es erneut."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Applied by the host. Cost: $%d."
msgstr "Vom Host angewendet. Kosten: $%d."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "City settings changed. Reopen Multiplayer and try again."
msgstr ""
"Stadteinstellungen geändert. Öffne Multiplayer erneut und versuche es noch "
"einmal."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid city option."
msgstr "Ungültige Stadtoption."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid disaster request."
