msgstr "Katastropheneinstellungen können nicht geändert werden."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid budget."
msgstr "Ungültiges Budget."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid budget percentage."
msgstr "Ungültiger Budgetprozentsatz."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid industry tax rate."
msgstr "Ungültiger Industriesteuersatz."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid ordinance."
msgstr "Ungültige Verordnung."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
