msgstr "Wähle ein Datum nach dem aktuellen Datum."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Debug · %s"
msgstr "Debug · %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Chat (%d)"
msgstr "Chat (%d)"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid emergency service target."
msgstr "Ungültiges Einsatzziel."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
