msgstr "Ungültiger Kartenstand."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Your emergency units were recalled."
msgstr "Deine Einsatzkräfte wurden zurückgerufen."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Manual disasters can only be started in your own municipality."
msgstr ""
"Manuelle Katastrophen können nur in der eigenen Gemeinde gestartet werden."

