"K{{phrase:6}}dida{{phrase:7}}n alle aus. In der darauffolgenden Runde, die 2"
" Stunden daue{{phrase:4}}, schei{{phrase:7}}{{phrase:4}}n alle fünf "
"K{{phrase:6}}dida{{phrase:7}}n {{phrase:6}} Wö{{phrase:4}}rn wie "
"\"Hypothese\" oder \"Kath{{phrase:2}}r\". "

#. German newspaper wording; named markers preserve the original
