" müssen wir umziehen.\""

#. German newspaper wording; named markers preserve the original
#. substitutions.
msgctxt "original"
msgid "SC2K newspaper phrase 501"
msgstr ""
"{{paragraph}}{{random_table:131}}: \"Das ist schon ziemlich eklig. Wenn wir "
