msgctxt "original"
msgid "SC2K newspaper phrase 508"
msgstr ""
"{{paragraph}}{{random_table:132}}: \"Hust, keuch, ächz, wie bitte? "
"Ochochocho-öhömm!! Jaja, g{{phrase:6}}z übel! Stöhn...\""

#. German newspaper wording; named markers preserve the original
